# Git authorship

Only `Abhishek Takale <abhishek.takale1995@gmail.com>` may appear as author or committer.

- Use the repo git identity already set; do not add `--author` for anyone else.
- Do not add `Co-authored-by`, `Made-with: Cursor`, Cursor, cursoragent, or any other person or bot to commit messages or PRs.
- Do not use `git commit --trailer`.
- Do not run `git config` to change user.name or user.email.
- After committing, if a trailer was injected, strip it (rewrite the commit object if not yet pushed) before pushing.
- Repo `.githooks/commit-msg` strips Cursor/cursoragent trailers. `npm install` sets `core.hooksPath` to `.githooks`.
